  "coverage": [
    "Mixed-height streamed MMCS matches upstream plain MMCS caps and paths, preserving original matrix order within height ties and sponge state across partial-rate tile and matrix boundaries.",
    "Native hidden batches combine preprocessing, base/quadratic/cubic traces, complete quotient partitions and duplicate inputs. Upstream hiding PCS and MMCS supply independent caps, openings and CPU verification.",
    "Caps at heights 0, 1 and 6; query counts 1, 4, 33 and 256 preserve duplicates and original matrix order. Postcard encoding matches upstream byte-for-byte. Altered values, salts and paths reject against the CPU verifier.",
    "Salt recipes are captured in original matrix order before height sorting under one active-stream lock, with all slots admitted before the first draw.",
    "Retained prefixes are bit-reversed evaluations on the generator coset, not coefficients. Exact retention equals prefixes plus Merkle nodes; no full LDE or salt matrix is retained.",
    "A 13.75 MiB full LDE commits and answers queries under an 8 MiB managed GPU budget and 2 MiB allocation ceiling. Transfer checks permit only public roots/status before final query values, salts and paths.",
    "Aggregate host output, device storage and allocation counts are admitted before private work. Early memory pressure preserves cursor state; late query memory pressure allows a successful retry. Failed or panicking producers cannot publish a partial tree and failures retire every participating RNG family.",
    "All 89 native CUDA tests pass; 88 pass under each of memory/leak, race and synchronization checks. The intentional missing-kernel API error runs separately. Challenger and RNG adapters also pass all three sanitizer tools.",
    "CPU-only, OpenCL and standalone CUDA library checks, Apple Metal cross-compilation, relevant OpenCL device regressions and source-completeness tests pass. The CUDA stream feature builds under a 6 GiB host cap and passes seven new commitment/query tests under the 3 GiB test cap."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "This completes native hidden commitment storage and MMCS queries, not the full CUDA hiding PCS or prover. Out-of-domain openings, opening reductions, FRI/final polynomial work, remaining proof stages, backend selection and worker integration remain unfinished.",
    "No complete native CUDA proof performance or transaction throughput is established. Existing proof formats, verifier behavior and security parameters are unchanged.",
    "Execution is qualified on the desktop RTX 5080 only. Compute_70/compute_120 kernel compilation and Apple Metal cross-compilation do not establish V100 or Metal hardware execution."
  ],
  "qualification_note": "Final implementation source was frozen and rebuilt for 34 main checks plus two stream-feature checks. All 753 source files match the staged Git blobs. The stream test executable was discovered from Cargo JSON rather than assuming the ordinary feature build hash. The ordinary build and all GPU tests use 3 GiB host caps; the stream build uses 6 GiB and one build job. All services prohibit swap and use four CPU threads.",
